WEBVTT

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:12.810
Damn kids!

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:16.420
What the heck are they
doing in a place like this?

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.490
Shouldn't they be in school?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.490
They may be runaways.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.930
What are you doing?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.200
They're just in the way.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.570
Brother?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.870
Damn... damn!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.640
Pathetic.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:48.320
So pathetic, I'd like to
see their parents' faces.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.280
Brother!

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:08.870
Huh?!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.000
What happened?!

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.710
She collapsed suddenly!

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:25.460
She did it.

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.480
Kayo did it again.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:16.130
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.270
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:24.450
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:32.020
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:36.020
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:42.690
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.030
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:52.870
No one knows her true face.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.710
Hey, Miyu.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.050
Shall I try and guess
what you're thinking now?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.820
Chisato is so easily influenced.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.430
Hey, did you watch TV last night?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.260
There was a show called
"Do supernatural powers exist?"

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.770
Sounds unscientific!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.870
I've read many reports
around the world...

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.240
of phenomenon that
can only be explained...

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.770
through the supernatural but...

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:01.150
Well, that may be the case somewhere
around the world, but not in Chisato.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:03.740
We don't know until we try!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.980
Here she goes.

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.610
She's been doing this all morning!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.320
I can hear...

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.330
I can hear your thoughts, Miyu...

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:20.490
You're thinking you're hungry and you
want lunch break to start soon.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.890
Am I right?
Miyu, am I right?

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:23.830
Yes.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:27.810
No way! Is that true? Really?
I was right!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.780
For that matter, even I
could've figured that out.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.640
I have latent powers!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:35.110
Gee... she's nuts.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.210
She's hopeless.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.200
Huh?

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:57.300
Look, that girl is still there.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.860
Yeah, what is she doing?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.400
I don't know, but...

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.540
What can you see from over there?

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.620
You've been there since morning.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.800
I've been watching the school.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:25.960
Huh?

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.540
Is school a fun thing?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.780
I think it depends on the person.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.860
You don't think school is fun?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.350
It's hard to say.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.890
I want to go to school.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:05:59.760
Huh?

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.730
I want to go to school
and make lots of friends.

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:07.470
But... my brother
says I can't do that.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.840
Your brother?

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.670
Yeah.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.270
But...

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:15.410
my brother always protects me!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.820
I love him very much!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.390
Hey, Kayo!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.250
Brother!

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.450
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.210
Let's go Kayo.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:41.110
No. I'm playing with her.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.580
You shouldn't associate with people.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.580
That girl's been there since morning.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.520
What are her parents doing?

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.110
How sad.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.150
Brother!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.620
What's the matter?

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.890
Stay away!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.260
Brother!

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.770
Don't come near my sister!

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:13.570
No matter how nice people seem,
in their hearts people are...!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.280
People are what?

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:18.310
What?!

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:31.760
W... Who are you?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:49.330
Our parents died and we were
sent to an orphanage.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.640
After that I started
reading people's minds.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.050
I didn't know what it was at first.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.550
Since all I can do is
read people's minds...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.750
it wouldn't bother anyone
as long as I put up with it.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.720
But, Kayo's a different story.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.290
Kayo, too?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:19.530
Ever since our parents died,
I've been a parent for her as well.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.510
I'm her only blood relative.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.900
When Kayo sees people
upsetting me... Kayo...

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.440
Brother!

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.710
Ah!

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.890
She can't control her power.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.600
So we had to leave the orphanage.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.880
Nevertheless, Kayo's still a child.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:05.480
What am I supposed to do?!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.250
Show her power and prove
it to those who don't believe?!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.820
If I did that, she'd be taken
to an insane asylum immediately.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.760
We've no other choice but
to live by avoiding others.

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:20.930
That's the fate for those
who have such powers.

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.730
Fate?

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.810
Sister!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.170
Sister!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.940
How strange...

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.410
I can't read your mind.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.110
This is the first
time it's happened.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.550
Sister!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.620
Humph!

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.190
Human powers are limited at best.

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:54.990
Long ago, in Europe, there
were people with such abilities.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.700
What happened to them, Larva?

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:01.800
As one might expect,
they lived in seclusion.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.440
Although some of them were
persecuted as witches.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.140
Nothing goes well
when it involves humans.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:13.050
Huh?

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:17.850
What's wrong?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:18.960
Miyu...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.420
That is not like Miyu at all.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:17.380
Come here.
I'm just like you.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.450
Brother?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.180
We have to name this dog.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.170
Kayo, Kayo!

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.610
Mommy?

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:47.010
Ah, brother...

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.470
You stayed up late again!

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.920
You were probably watching
TV all night, huh?

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.190
I was studying!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:59.790
But I heard TV noises
coming from you room.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:00.860
Kayo!

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.160
Hey, hey, Kayo, clean up your plate.

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.790
I hate tomatoes!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.800
Don't be so picky about food!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.100
You too, dear, are you
reading or eating?

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.670
One thing at a time, please.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.110
Daddy got scolded, too.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:21.450
Then, I'd go to school
with my brother.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.220
How about you?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.460
What's your mommy like?

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.360
About me...

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.120
A dog?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.880
Yup, it never leaves
my brother's side.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.020
We haven't named it yet.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:28.550
Hey, hey, it's alright.

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:39.150
Brother!

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:40.380
Sorry you had to wait.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.230
I was with her...

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.430
the whole time.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.740
Thanks for looking after Kayo.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.900
We talked a whole bunch.

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:55.040
That's great, you got a playmate.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:07.390
Thank you for playing with me!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.120
See you tomorrow!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.580
Huh?

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:15.820
This girl, even if she lives,
it will be hopeless.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:20.530
Even if she lives on,
there will be no happiness.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.100
Brother, is anything wrong?

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.740
You can't be with her anymore.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.670
No? Why?!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.880
Because I said so.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:36.870
That girl!

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:41.410
Yes, she's trying
to kill your sister.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:45.380
If you don't kill her,
your sister will be killed.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.480
Kill that girl!

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.510
Who are you?
Who's saying that?

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.720
Don't you care if your
sister gets killed?

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.250
She's my sister's friend!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:59.160
Those with special powers
have no way to make friends.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:02.560
You're the only one who
can protect your sister.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.700
Kill that girl...

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.170
Kill her...

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.070
Kill her!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.610
Stop! Stop it!!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.690
What are you doing there?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.190
You!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.270
Not you.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.320
Huh?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.200
This isn't where you belong.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.770
Return to the Darkness.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.270
If you don't kill her,
your sister will die!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.340
Stop it!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.450
Stop using him!

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:57.490
S... Stop!

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:00.250
Step aside! He's a Shinma.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.260
No, he's not!

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.790
It's the Shinma who's talking to you.

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.790
No! He's just the same as me!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:08.490
He's my friend!

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:13.300
It seems even the
Guardian has a weakness.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.300
Now, kill that girl!!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.690
Why have you done this, Reiha!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.360
Even though I helped you?

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:43.700
You should appreciate what she did.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:51.170
CHO-JYU

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.140
Get out of my way!

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:41.960
Brother!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.630
What kind of human is that?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.900
She's quite violent, isn't she?

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.910
She's even worse than a Shinma.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.270
It's meaningless to
go on living as she is.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.440
Forget about her!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.080
It's meaningless to
go on living as she is.

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.020
Huh?

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:11.720
Miyu.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.230
Kayo.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.840
Give me back my brother!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.440
Give him back!!!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.280
Your brother won't be coming back.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.310
No!!!

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.460
He's no longer coming back.

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.460
Give me back my brother!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.230
No!!!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.810
Hey, wait up, Kayo!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:12.850
Hurry brother, we'll be late.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.590
See you later.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.480
See you, Mom!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.940
When it comes to girls,
she automatically gets soft.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.400
There's no reason to
give mercy to humans.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.710
She should just kill them.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:46.950
However, the affairs of humans
are of no concern to us.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.480
Shall we go?

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:52.590
Miyu.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:57.960
I see, the girl reminds
Miyu of her younger self.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:07.000
I guess I'm not psychic after all.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.040
What do you mean?

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.770
After you made such a big fuss?

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.610
Well, the results
of the test were so poor.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:14.210
That's right...

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.840
If you had supernatural powers,
you should get 100%.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:20.580
Ah, if only I had supernatural powers.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:24.750
You're better off without such things.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:25.660
Huh?

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:19.510
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:25.850
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:32.720
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:40.070
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:44.900
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:48.370
I don't need friends.

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:49.570
That's a lie.

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:52.570
I don't even need myself.

00:22:52.610 --> 00:22:53.710
It's the truth.

00:22:54.250 --> 00:23:02.090
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:09.520
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:18.600
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:26.610
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:33.580
In my place, the sky cries.
